@database
@wordwrap

@node Main "Main Index"

@{b}           Welcome to MrV2k's WHDLoad Database@{ub}
@{b}           -----------------------------------@{ub}

This Amigaguide database is based on the awesome WHDLoad collection
by Retroplay. This document is up to date as of 12-04-26. The games
and demos have been split alphabetically and there is a button next 
to each entry that will show the game information.

The information included has been collated from several sources
including the Hall Of Light, Lemon Amiga, Moby Games, Open Retro DB,
WHDLoad.de, Pouet and Janeway/Bitworld. Please show appreciation
of their hard work by supporting their sites.

All software titles are formatted in 'Title, The' for easier searching.

